BT /F2 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 42 790 Tm (Smart Attendance - Frontend Code) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 42 770 Tm (HOW THE FRONTEND IS USED) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 42 748 Tm (A quick guide to the parts shown in the code listing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 42 726 Tm (Python prepares the dashboard data. It reads the student roster and attendance from the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 42 713 Tm (configured CSV or MySQL storage, then places that data into the web page.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 42 691 Tm (HTML is the page structure: the date selector, summary cards, attendance tables, checkpoint) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 42 678 Tm (table, and footer that appear in the browser.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 42 656 Tm (CSS is the visual design. It sets the colors, spacing, cards, tables, and a layout that adjusts) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 42 643 Tm (for smaller screens.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 42 621 Tm (JavaScript fills the page with the supplied data. It builds the date choices and tables,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 42 608 Tm (calculates the displayed totals, and refreshes daily details when a date is selected.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 42 586 Tm (The checkpoint table shows observations from the latest recognition session. 'Not observed') Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 42 573 Tm (means the system did not recognize someone during that window; it does not decide that they were) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 42 560 Tm (absent.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 42 538 Tm (The Python script writes the finished page to reports/attendance_dashboard.html. Open that file) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 42 525 Tm (in a browser to use the dashboard. The dashboard displays information and does not change) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 1 0 0 1 42 512 Tm (attendance records.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 42 27 Tm (Source: recognition/attendance_dashboard.py) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 498 27 Tm (Page 3) Tj ET
